{"id":"wb-6-694","name":"李业阙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"李業闕","text":"李业阙，位于四川省绵阳市梓潼县南的长卿山麓，据阙上铭文推知其为汉朝侍御史李业的墓阙，同时为现存最早的汉阙。该墓阙最早记述于南宋，后被移动至李节士祠内保护，中华人民共和国成立后加修保护亭。该阙现仅存基石和阙身部分。2006年，李业阙被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%8E%E6%A5%AD%E9%97%95","revisionId":94224262,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94224262","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1134052948076e992cd031e2.jpg","title":"李业阙照片.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%9D%8E%E4%B8%9A%E9%98%99%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d0/%E6%9D%8E%E4%B8%9A%E9%98%99%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Liye Stele","width":320,"height":434}}